sketch-warehouse-schema-intro.bodyMarkdown:
A warehouse team is replacing a spreadsheet with a small stock-ledger database.

Across six milestones you will build one cumulative schema:

1. create the warehouse table;
2. protect warehouse identity and names;
3. add a warehouse operating default;
4. create the movement table;
5. require complete movement records;
6. add the movement default and warehouse relationship.

`schema.sql` carries the complete schema forward. `query.sql` changes as needed to inspect the current milestone.
